WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:50.620
Someone once said...

00:01:50.620 --> 00:01:53.420
There are top-grade endomame

00:01:53.420 --> 00:02:01.030
that can only be eaten after peeling 
off layer upon layer of seed pods...

00:02:04.430 --> 00:02:08.470
Endlessmame!

00:02:09.640 --> 00:02:16.840
There are tadpoles that have 
first-rate, savory tea leaf tails...

00:02:16.840 --> 00:02:20.950
Tea Tadpoles!

00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:24.050
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:24.050 --> 00:02:28.960
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:35.730
To find a hint for the menu of the 
Summit's "Great Job, Everyone Party",

00:02:35.730 --> 00:02:38.400
Komatsu and Toriko headed for Gourmet Beach.

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:42.240
However, the curry shop they 
had in mind was closed.

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:46.340
Toriko and Komatsu went out to sea in 
order to capture the curry ingredients,

00:02:46.340 --> 00:02:48.710
and met Cumin's little sister, Saffra.

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:52.510
Then an Island Horse 
appeared before their eyes.

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:58.080
They discovered a lot of curry 
ingredients on the island.

00:02:58.520 --> 00:03:04.660
Suddenly, a Beast with its body covered 
in water emerged from the bushes!

00:03:06.360 --> 00:03:10.900
The Ties that Bind! Superb 
Gobbling Katsu Curry!

00:03:21.070 --> 00:03:23.840
A tiger with water pouring out of its body...

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:25.410
A Water Tiger!

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:29.210
This guy's the main ingredient in the curry.

00:03:32.380 --> 00:03:33.750
Th-That's dangerous!

00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:34.820
Zombie-san!

00:03:34.820 --> 00:03:36.090
Don't get it wrong every time!

00:03:36.090 --> 00:03:37.920
Was that on purpose?! It 
was on purpose, wasn't it?!

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:40.390
Whatever, let's just get out of here!

00:03:42.690 --> 00:03:44.560
Flying Fork!

00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:50.330
We'll handle this, Komatsu!

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:52.870
Take Saffra and get another ingredient!

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:53.770
Right!

00:03:53.770 --> 00:03:54.470
Gotcha!

00:03:56.640 --> 00:03:58.540
Super Relax...

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:20.000
Terry!

00:04:26.670 --> 00:04:28.500
What destructive force!

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:31.440
Leg Knife!

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:41.720
15-fold...

00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:43.450
...Spiked Punch!

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:51.760
No effect!

00:04:51.760 --> 00:04:55.030
Then Single Point Concentration!

00:04:55.030 --> 00:04:56.900
Icepick...

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:02.470
Toriko!

00:05:02.470 --> 00:05:03.870
I'm okay, Rin!

00:05:03.870 --> 00:05:05.970
It's not givin' me a chance here!

00:05:12.980 --> 00:05:14.980
Consommenattoroast!

00:05:14.980 --> 00:05:17.520
Stop! You're not getting away!

00:05:27.530 --> 00:05:29.000
Saffra-san!

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:31.030
Leave this to me!

00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:45.950
I did it!

00:05:46.350 --> 00:05:48.980
This skin is going to make fine consomme!

00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:50.880
Wow!

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:56.190
Potacarronion Chicken!

00:05:56.190 --> 00:05:57.960
You're not getting away!

00:05:57.960 --> 00:06:00.130
Wait, wait! Saffra-san!

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:03.460
I'm going to gather the 
ingredients, no matter what...

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:08.530
...because Cumin, the cook, believes in me!

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:26.720
Saffra...

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:52.980
Hey, I heard those guys escaped 
and jumped into the sea.

00:06:52.980 --> 00:06:55.610
They're goners for sure 
in this part of the sea.

00:06:55.610 --> 00:06:57.280
The idiots...

00:06:57.280 --> 00:06:58.920
What was that one's name, Zombie?

00:07:04.520 --> 00:07:07.120
Land? Here?

00:07:08.460 --> 00:07:10.290
It seems something has come into view.

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:21.140
They even come crawling up here?!

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:22.840
Not beautiful at all!

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:37.620
Poison Rifle!

00:07:38.920 --> 00:07:40.990
Go back to the sea!

00:07:40.990 --> 00:07:42.560
Spatula!

00:07:50.230 --> 00:07:51.070
Yum.

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:58.440
Dead end! What should we do?!

00:07:58.440 --> 00:07:59.840
Let's climb!

00:08:00.340 --> 00:08:01.340
Climb?

00:08:01.340 --> 00:08:02.080
Right!

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:03.850
Quickly, quickly!

00:08:16.490 --> 00:08:18.960
Ingredients have fallen from the heavens.

00:08:18.960 --> 00:08:21.260
I have great Food Luck when I'm with you.

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:37.080
We have to do something about that water!

00:08:50.860 --> 00:08:52.130
This way!

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:53.530
Chase me!

00:09:09.880 --> 00:09:12.050
Flying Knife!

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:22.090
Toriko!

00:09:33.900 --> 00:09:35.600
It's out of steam!

00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:39.610
Looks like a body that has water 
spilling out of it weakens with heat.

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:42.770
Thanks to the scorching 
rays of the blazing sun...

00:09:42.770 --> 00:09:46.310
...and this place that I sniffed out, 
maybe not as hot as Wool Volcano,

00:09:46.310 --> 00:09:49.250
but still a fiery hell that stole 
the water coming out of your body

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:51.350
by suddenly turning it into steam!

00:09:55.790 --> 00:10:00.760
Water Tiger, King of the Sea, that can 
transform and manipulate water at will...

00:10:00.760 --> 00:10:03.060
...you have my respect.

00:10:04.130 --> 00:10:08.030
I give thanks for all this 
world's great bounty!

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:12.300
Time to eat!

00:10:12.740 --> 00:10:14.540
15-fold...

00:10:15.810 --> 00:10:18.040
...Spiked Punch!

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:38.260
Thank you for the food.

00:10:52.140 --> 00:10:55.180
Saffra! You're okay!

00:10:55.180 --> 00:10:57.150
Thank goodness!

00:10:57.150 --> 00:10:58.050
Yeesh!

00:10:58.050 --> 00:11:00.920
I told you before, if you're gonna cry, 
at least do it while chopping onions!

00:11:01.650 --> 00:11:04.050
Well, now comes the real challenge.

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:05.890
Can you make delicious curry or not?

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:07.620
It all rides on your ability, Cumin!

00:11:10.030 --> 00:11:10.960
Come on!

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:12.530
Thank you...

00:11:12.530 --> 00:11:14.930
I'll help you, Cumin-san!

00:11:15.200 --> 00:11:17.100
Chef Komatsu...

00:11:17.100 --> 00:11:18.900
Thank you!

00:11:23.970 --> 00:11:25.670
Alright! Let's do this!

00:11:25.670 --> 00:11:26.540
Right!

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:29.610
First, we'll start with 
the Potacarronion Chicken!

00:11:35.450 --> 00:11:39.320
The potatoes, carrots, and onions are 
fresh and they've got a rich taste!

00:11:39.320 --> 00:11:41.190
They'll make great ingredients!

00:11:41.190 --> 00:11:44.530
Then I'll chop the Consommenattoroast's skin!

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:51.770
And this Tapioclam is huge!

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:53.500
It's the first time I've seen one this size!

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:56.500
The rice is really big, too!

00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:58.910
I can tell they'll have a nice, mellow scent!

00:11:59.340 --> 00:12:02.240
I smell a heaping helping of savory aroma!

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:05.210
I'm hungry!

00:12:05.210 --> 00:12:06.850
I can't wait!

00:12:11.020 --> 00:12:14.050
I'm putting in some Boiled Bat Broccoli!

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:22.260
How is it?

00:12:22.260 --> 00:12:23.460
No.

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:26.470
The savoriness and mellowness of Dad's curry

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:28.270
were in a different league than this.

00:12:28.670 --> 00:12:34.210
In fact, if all the flavors of the 
ingredients aren't in harmony,

00:12:34.210 --> 00:12:36.680
they'll be overpowered 
by the taste of the roux!

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:40.150
I'll try adding more vegetables.

00:12:49.220 --> 00:12:53.060
Hmm... Smoke Salmon meat...

00:13:09.370 --> 00:13:10.740
Cumin-san!

00:13:10.740 --> 00:13:11.840
It's no good.

00:13:12.110 --> 00:13:15.050
Something's missing!

00:13:17.120 --> 00:13:20.750
Cumin-san! There's something 
you haven't tried yet!

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:23.390
That's right, Bro! Keep your chin up!

00:13:23.390 --> 00:13:25.820
Put in a little more effort!

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:28.230
It's no good! I can't!

00:13:28.230 --> 00:13:29.260
Bro...

00:13:29.260 --> 00:13:30.330
Cumin-san...

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:35.930
Making Dad's curry...

00:13:35.930 --> 00:13:39.970
In the end, it's just impossible for me!

00:13:40.970 --> 00:13:42.410
You're crying again?!

00:13:42.410 --> 00:13:44.710
Like I'm always telling 
you, if you're gonna cry...

00:13:44.710 --> 00:13:46.640
I already peeled the onions!

00:13:53.650 --> 00:13:55.120
Gobbling Katsu Curry!

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:57.250
I look forward to it every summer, you know?!

00:13:57.250 --> 00:14:00.160
Sorry! It's still being prepared.

00:14:00.160 --> 00:14:01.790
Really?!

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:03.290
Then what should we do?

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:04.290
Go home?

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:05.630
Cumin-san...

00:14:05.630 --> 00:14:09.700
Maybe you're thinking too much about 
following your father's curry.

00:14:10.170 --> 00:14:12.600
I think the most important 
thing about cooking

00:14:12.600 --> 00:14:15.710
is having your customers enjoy 
themselves eating delicious food.

00:14:15.710 --> 00:14:17.010
That's right.

00:14:17.010 --> 00:14:20.640
I said I wanted to eat Gobbling Katsu Curry.

00:14:20.640 --> 00:14:24.080
I didn't say anything about 
eating your dad's curry.

00:14:24.080 --> 00:14:29.320
Certainly, Dad seemed happy 
watching the customers smile.

00:14:29.320 --> 00:14:32.960
And he took good care of 
his cooking utensils, too.

00:14:32.960 --> 00:14:35.290
He must have been a wonderful cook.

00:14:35.960 --> 00:14:37.030
Um...

00:14:37.030 --> 00:14:37.990
What is it?

00:14:37.990 --> 00:14:40.800
I thought the same thing when 
I looked at it before...

00:14:40.800 --> 00:14:43.670
...but this is kind of an odd knife.

00:14:43.670 --> 00:14:44.730
That's...

00:14:44.730 --> 00:14:46.570
A High Branches Pruning Knife.

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:56.510
Saffra-san!

00:15:04.620 --> 00:15:05.790
Saffra!

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:15.500
Dad! Over there! Over there!

00:15:17.160 --> 00:15:19.470
Alright! Leave it to me!

00:15:21.840 --> 00:15:26.010
Dad often cut them down for 
us to eat when we were kids.

00:15:29.480 --> 00:15:32.010
We always looked forward to it, didn't we?

00:15:48.860 --> 00:15:51.700
Gobbling Katsu Curry is complete!

00:15:52.730 --> 00:15:57.500
Curry with plenty of ingredients and 
awe-inspiringly sparkling katsu!

00:15:57.500 --> 00:16:00.610
Full marks for volume <i>and</i> it looks delicious!

00:16:00.610 --> 00:16:02.370
Well, okay?

00:16:02.370 --> 00:16:05.980
I give thanks for all this 
world's great bounty!

00:16:06.680 --> 00:16:08.410
Let's eat!

00:16:08.410 --> 00:16:10.480
Let's eat!

00:16:13.650 --> 00:16:15.650
Delicious...

00:16:15.650 --> 00:16:19.090
This curry has such deep, rich flavor!

00:16:19.090 --> 00:16:23.560
The savoriness of the meat, fish, and 
vegetables has united with the roux

00:16:23.560 --> 00:16:27.400
and it's like they're running 
around dancing inside my mouth!

00:16:27.400 --> 00:16:30.870
And this Water Tiger katsu!

00:16:30.870 --> 00:16:36.640
Even as it melts in my mouth in an 
instant, the meat juices overflow!

00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:40.280
Even after you swallow it, the curry 
flavor keeps spreading through my mouth!

00:16:40.280 --> 00:16:43.250
The mellow taste envelopes my whole body!

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:47.550
The Porcupine Potato Chips are crispy 
and totally go with the curry!

00:16:47.550 --> 00:16:50.850
Gobbling Katsu Curry! This 
is the moment of its revival!

00:16:52.260 --> 00:16:55.160
Could this curry be even more delicious 
than the previous generation's?

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:58.000
Yeah. The deep flavor is 
even better than your dad's!

00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:01.060
It's a heaping helping of delicious!

00:17:04.170 --> 00:17:05.700
Come to think of it, Saffra,

00:17:05.700 --> 00:17:10.070
when you got the Tapioclams, 
you dove really deeply.

00:17:10.070 --> 00:17:12.980
Because of that, the clams you got 
were bigger and more delicious

00:17:12.980 --> 00:17:15.210
than the ones your dad got every year.

00:17:15.210 --> 00:17:18.580
That's where this flavor comes from.

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:22.250
And as a finishing touch, I 
tried using this fruit, too.

00:17:22.250 --> 00:17:23.590
Bon Bon Udo Fruit.

00:17:23.590 --> 00:17:24.990
I see...

00:17:24.990 --> 00:17:28.090
A whiskey bon bon made from the 
pulp of a chocolate fruit...

00:17:28.090 --> 00:17:30.990
The mellowness of the chocolate 
wrapped all of the ingredients up,

00:17:30.990 --> 00:17:32.660
making them harmonize all at once.

00:17:32.660 --> 00:17:36.830
This fruit is a memorable 
food for me and my sister.

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:53.680
Dad...

00:17:57.290 --> 00:18:01.260
I never would've guessed the final 
ingredient would be so close to us.

00:18:01.520 --> 00:18:03.530
Saffra... Thank you.

00:18:03.860 --> 00:18:07.830
Without you, these ingredients 
would never have been gathered.

00:18:08.730 --> 00:18:10.630
You're crying again!

00:18:10.630 --> 00:18:13.700
Tears of joy are different 
than being a crybaby!

00:18:13.700 --> 00:18:17.040
True, the power of the 
ingredients is part of it,

00:18:17.040 --> 00:18:19.770
but I don't think that's all it is!

00:18:19.770 --> 00:18:21.280
Cumin-san and Saffra-san,

00:18:21.280 --> 00:18:27.010
your feelings for your father made 
the curry even more delicious.

00:18:28.180 --> 00:18:29.780
Bon Bon Udo.

00:18:29.780 --> 00:18:33.990
Cumin-san and Saffra-san, you've always 
looked out for your family, huh?

00:18:33.990 --> 00:18:38.160
The father wanted his children 
to use their own strength

00:18:38.160 --> 00:18:40.430
to carve a path for themselves.

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:44.230
I'm sure he's happy right now...

00:18:44.460 --> 00:18:45.330
Yes...

00:18:53.640 --> 00:18:57.040
Even without onions, it's okay to cry.

00:18:59.180 --> 00:19:00.910
That curry smells delicious!

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:02.450
It's ready!

00:19:02.450 --> 00:19:04.580
Three helpings, please!

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:06.390
Welcome!

00:19:07.550 --> 00:19:10.320
What is this? It's delicious!

00:19:10.320 --> 00:19:11.660
It really is!

00:19:12.190 --> 00:19:13.230
Delicious!

00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:17.460
This has turned out wonderfully, 
hasn't it, Toriko-san?!

00:19:17.460 --> 00:19:20.230
Let me have some, too!

00:19:22.730 --> 00:19:24.500
Th-That was...

00:19:24.500 --> 00:19:26.370
Yeah... Sound Bullet.

00:19:30.840 --> 00:19:33.710
They're not running away, 
but keep forming a line.

00:19:33.710 --> 00:19:36.010
That's how much they want to eat it.

00:19:36.010 --> 00:19:36.880
Yo...

00:19:36.880 --> 00:19:37.680
Zebra-san!

00:19:37.680 --> 00:19:38.180
Zebra!

00:19:38.180 --> 00:19:39.480
Long time no see.

00:19:41.750 --> 00:19:43.990
Zebra! I don't believe it!

00:19:44.460 --> 00:19:46.260
Camera!

00:19:46.720 --> 00:19:48.460
Zebra!

00:19:48.460 --> 00:19:52.060
I mean, camera!

00:19:52.060 --> 00:19:54.500
My scoop...!

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:56.130
I could hear...

00:19:56.630 --> 00:19:59.940
...about the cocky curry.

00:19:59.940 --> 00:20:02.470
Is this it?

00:20:12.150 --> 00:20:14.650
Don't get cocky!

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:17.050
It's okay!

00:20:17.050 --> 00:20:19.320
That means it's delicious!

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:28.400
Isn't it beautiful?!

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:34.170
What are these?

00:20:34.170 --> 00:20:37.210
Biscuits that fly up out of the sea 
in the summer like fireworks...

00:20:37.210 --> 00:20:39.010
Firework Biscuits!

00:20:40.010 --> 00:20:42.040
Delicious!

00:20:46.750 --> 00:20:48.550
What a beautiful view.

00:20:48.550 --> 00:20:51.350
You were awake?

00:20:53.520 --> 00:20:55.090
Goodnight.

00:20:57.990 --> 00:21:00.530
Thank you, Toriko-san, everyone.

00:21:01.300 --> 00:21:02.430
Saffra...

00:21:04.530 --> 00:21:06.230
Onii-chan...

00:21:06.900 --> 00:21:09.100
Beautiful, aren't they?

00:21:09.100 --> 00:21:10.370
Yes!

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:12.770
Good job today!

00:21:14.880 --> 00:21:16.140
What's wrong?

00:21:16.140 --> 00:21:20.080
I didn't think about the menu for 
the "Great Job, Everyone Party"!

00:21:20.080 --> 00:21:23.680
Oh, well, you can always think 
about it after you get back, right?

00:21:23.680 --> 00:21:25.020
What should I do?!

00:21:25.020 --> 00:21:27.320
You'll think of something! Right?

00:21:28.660 --> 00:21:30.790
I guess so...

00:21:34.660 --> 00:21:37.360
We give thanks for this food, let's eat!

00:21:41.600 --> 00:21:43.200
Yuuuu... Toriko!

00:21:43.200 --> 00:21:45.970
Potassium, manganese, calcium, 
starch, fructose, and dextrose

00:21:45.970 --> 00:21:48.780
Magnesium, iron, vitamins ABCDE

00:21:48.780 --> 00:21:51.610
Vanadium, sodium, glucosamine, chondroitin

00:21:51.610 --> 00:21:54.480
Carotintintin, lycopenpenpene, 
isoflavonvonvone

00:21:54.480 --> 00:21:57.180
Celery, goya, and green peas

00:21:57.180 --> 00:22:00.020
Shiitake, liver, eggplant, bell pepper

00:22:00.020 --> 00:22:02.720
What a shame to say "I don't 
even want to look at them!"

00:22:02.720 --> 00:22:04.390
Even if you hate it, gobble 
it down 3 times or 4 times

00:22:04.390 --> 00:22:05.790
and it'll be more and more

00:22:05.790 --> 00:22:07.160
Yuuuu... Toriko!

00:22:07.160 --> 00:22:09.960
Eat 'em up more! Eat 'em up more!

00:22:09.960 --> 00:22:12.830
More and more and more and 
more and more! Eat 'em all up!

00:22:12.830 --> 00:22:17.100
Delicious things are delicious!  
Not even giving them a chance…

00:22:17.100 --> 00:22:18.400
Such a waste!

00:22:18.400 --> 00:22:21.270
Gobble 'em down more! Gobble 'em down more!

00:22:21.270 --> 00:22:24.040
Majorly, deeply, plentifully, 
heartily, gobble 'em down!

00:22:24.040 --> 00:22:29.680
They enrich your body and spirit! 
Be grateful to your meals today!

00:22:29.680 --> 00:22:32.550
Thanks for the food! All done!

00:22:35.450 --> 00:22:37.590
Gourmet News!

00:22:38.660 --> 00:22:40.290
I'm your host, Tina.

00:22:40.290 --> 00:22:44.230
Today, I'll introduce the dishes that 
won the 2nd Gourmet Monster Contest

00:22:44.230 --> 00:22:47.800
and made their debut in this story!

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:48.970
Water Tiger!

00:22:48.970 --> 00:22:50.400
Bon Bon Udo!

00:22:50.400 --> 00:22:51.370
Endlessmame!

00:22:51.370 --> 00:22:52.840
Tea Tadpoles!

00:22:52.840 --> 00:22:53.940
Bat Broccoli!

00:22:53.940 --> 00:22:55.140
Black Soil Snake!

00:22:55.140 --> 00:22:56.240
Fairy Tale Palm Tree!

00:22:56.240 --> 00:22:57.510
Roboster!

00:22:57.510 --> 00:22:59.410
Firework Biscuits!

00:22:59.410 --> 00:23:03.110
Thank you for participating, everyone.

00:23:03.110 --> 00:23:05.180
Now, on to the next story!

00:23:07.150 --> 00:23:09.190
The battle over GOD is on the horizon.

00:23:09.370 --> 00:23:12.480
As Toriko grows determined to fight, that man closes in from behind!

00:23:13.260 --> 00:23:16.590
New Phase! Toriko's Decision and the Reunion With 'Him'!

00:23:16.890 --> 00:23:18.510
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
